msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Quitar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:695
msgid "Also delete the mission file from disk"
msgstr "Eliminar también el archivo de la misión del disco"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:697
msgid ""
"Removes the primary file, its .dcssb copy and the .orig. This cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el archivo principal, su copia .dcssb y el .orig. Esto no se "
"puede deshacer."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:702
msgid ""
"<b>The mission is removed from the rotation list and stops being "
"loaded.</b> The box below is off by default: with it ticked the mission "
"file itself — the primary, its .dcssb copy and the .orig — is deleted "
"from the server, and that cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"<b>La misión se quita de la lista de rotación y deja de cargarse.</b> La "
"casilla de abajo está desactivada por defecto: si la marcas, el propio "
"archivo de la misión — el principal, su copia .dcssb y el .orig — se "
"elimina del servidor, y eso no se puede deshacer."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:706
msgid ""
"Removing it from the list changes the rotation only; the file stays on "
"the server unless you tick the box. Discord's /mission delete asks the "
"same two questions."
msgstr ""
"Quitarla de la lista solo cambia la rotación; el archivo se queda en el "
"servidor a menos que marques la casilla. /mission delete de Discord hace "
"las mismas dos preguntas."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:709
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:4051
msgid "Remove mission"
msgstr "Quitar misión"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:710
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Remove the mission from {server}'s rotation list"
msgstr "Quitar la misión de la lista de rotación de {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:712
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:566
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Cargar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:717
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:641
msgid "Upload mission"
msgstr "Subir misión"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:732
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:752
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:4056
msgid "Remove missions"
msgstr "Quitar misiones"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:736
msgid "Also delete the mission files from disk"
msgstr "Eliminar también los archivos de las misiones del disco"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:738
msgid ""
"Removes the primary file, its .dcssb copy and the .orig of EVERY selected"
" mission. This cannot be undone. Left OFF, the mission only leaves the "
"rotation — and while the server's mission auto-scan is on, a mission file"
" left on disk is re-added to the list, so the removal is not permanent."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el archivo principal, su copia .dcssb y el .orig de CADA misión "
"seleccionada. Esto no se puede deshacer. Si se deja DESACTIVADA, la "
"misión solo sale de la rotación — y mientras el autoescaneo de misiones "
"del servidor esté activado, un archivo de misión que quede en el disco se"
" vuelve a añadir a la lista, así que la eliminación no es permanente."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:746
msgid ""
"<b>The selected missions are removed from the rotation list and stop "
"being loaded.</b> The box below is off by default: with it ticked the "
"mission files themselves are deleted from the server, and that cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"<b>Las misiones seleccionadas se quitan de la lista de rotación y dejan "
"de cargarse.</b> La casilla de abajo está desactivada por defecto: si la "
"marcas, los propios archivos de misión se eliminan del servidor, y eso no"
" se puede deshacer."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:750
msgid ""
"The chosen missions leave the rotation list; their files stay on the "
"server unless you tick the box."
msgstr ""
"Las misiones elegidas salen de la lista de rotación; sus archivos se "
"quedan en el servidor a menos que marques la casilla."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:753
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Remove the selected missions from {server}'s rotation list"
msgstr "Quitar las misiones seleccionadas de la lista de rotación de {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:757
msgid "Move"
msgstr "Mover"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:771
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:477
msgid "Set as start"
msgstr "Establecer como inicio"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:872
msgid "Kick"
msgstr "Expulsar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:874
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:890
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Motivo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:875
msgid "Shown to the player in game."
msgstr "Se muestra al jugador en el juego."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:877
msgid "Kick — disconnected now; they may rejoin immediately"
msgstr "Expulsar — se le desconecta ahora; puede volver a entrar de inmediato"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:878
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Kick {player} from {server}"
msgstr "Expulsar a {player} de {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:879
msgid "disconnected now — a kick is not a ban"
msgstr "se le desconecta ahora — una expulsión no es un baneo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:880
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{player} is disconnected from {server} now.</b> They can rejoin "
"immediately — a kick is not a ban and leaves no block behind."
msgstr ""
"<b>{player} queda desconectado de {server} ahora.</b> Puede volver a "
"entrar de inmediato — una expulsión no es un baneo y no deja ningún "
"bloqueo."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:882
msgid ""
"A kick ends their session; it blocks nothing and expires with it. Nothing"
" is written to the ban list, so they may be back in the air in a minute."
msgstr ""
"Una expulsión termina su sesión; no bloquea nada y expira con ella. No se"
" escribe nada en la lista de baneos, así que puede volver a volar en un "
"minuto."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:885
msgid "Kick player"
msgstr "Expulsar jugador"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:886
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Kick {player} from {server} — they may rejoin immediately"
msgstr "Expulsar a {player} de {server} — puede volver a entrar de inmediato"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:888
msgid "Ban"
msgstr "Banear"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:891
msgid "Kept on the ban list."
msgstr "Se mantiene en la lista de baneos."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:893
msgid "Ban — removed and blocked from rejoining"
msgstr "Banear — se le expulsa y se le bloquea para volver a entrar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:894
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ban {player} from {server}"
msgstr "Banear a {player} de {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:895
msgid "removed and blocked from rejoining"
msgstr "se le expulsa y se le bloquea para volver a entrar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:896
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{player} is removed from {server} and cannot rejoin it</b> for as long"
" as the ban stands. Empty duration means it never expires on its own."
msgstr ""
"<b>{player} queda expulsado de {server} y no puede volver a entrar</b> "
"mientras el baneo siga vigente. Una duración vacía significa que nunca "
"expira por sí solo."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:899
msgid ""
"The ban is written to the ban list every installation syncs, so it holds "
"wherever they connect from — not only on this server."
msgstr ""
"El baneo se escribe en la lista de baneos que sincronizan todas las "
"instalaciones, así que se mantiene desde donde se conecte — no solo en "
"este servidor."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:901
msgid "Ban player"
msgstr "Banear jugador"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:902
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ban {player} — empty duration is permanent"
msgstr "Banear a {player} — una duración vacía es permanente"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:904
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:905
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Mensaje"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:909
msgid "Chat — a chat line in game, visible to everyone"
msgstr "Chat — una línea de chat en el juego, visible para todos"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:910
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Send a chat line to {player} on {server}"
msgstr "Enviar una línea de chat a {player} en {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:912
msgid "Popup — a private message in game"
msgstr "Popup — un mensaje privado en el juego"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:913
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Send a popup to {player} on {server}"
msgstr "Enviar un popup a {player} en {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:916
msgid "Mute"
msgstr "Silenciar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:917
msgid "Mute — they can no longer send chat"
msgstr "Silenciar — ya no podrá enviar chat"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:918
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Mute {player} on {server}"
msgstr "Silenciar a {player} en {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:919
msgid "they can no longer send chat"
msgstr "ya no podrá enviar chat"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:921
msgid "Unmute"
msgstr "Reactivar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:922
msgid "Unmute — restore their chat"
msgstr "Reactivar — restaura su chat"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:923
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unmute {player} on {server}"
msgstr "Reactivar a {player} en {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:924
msgid "restore their chat"
msgstr "restaura su chat"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1020
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart node — every server on {node} goes down while the node restarts"
msgstr ""
"Reiniciar nodo — todos los servidores de {node} se caen mientras el nodo "
"se reinicia"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1021
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart node {node}"
msgstr "Reiniciar el nodo {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1022
msgid "every server on the node goes down"
msgstr "todos los servidores del nodo se caen"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1023
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1055
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>Every server on {node} goes down with it</b> — {servers} server(s) and"
" {players} player(s) are on it right now."
msgstr ""
"<b>Todos los servidores de {node} se caen con él</b> — ahora mismo hay "
"{servers} servidor(es) y {players} jugador(es) en él."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1025
msgid ""
"A node restart ends the bot process on that machine; the launcher there "
"brings the node back, and its servers do not: they stay down until "
"somebody starts them again."
msgstr ""
"Un reinicio del nodo termina el proceso del bot en esa máquina; el "
"lanzador de allí recupera el nodo, pero sus servidores no: permanecen "
"caídos hasta que alguien vuelva a iniciarlos."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1028
msgid ""
"<b>This console runs inside that node</b> — restarting it ends the "
"process serving this page, and this window has to be reloaded once the "
"node is back."
msgstr ""
"<b>Esta consola se ejecuta dentro de ese nodo</b> — reiniciarlo termina "
"el proceso que sirve esta página, y habrá que recargar esta ventana "
"cuando el nodo vuelva."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1031
msgid "Restart node"
msgstr "Reiniciar nodo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1032
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart {node} — every server on it goes down"
msgstr "Reiniciar {node} — todos sus servidores se caen"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1035
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Shut down node — every server on {node} goes down and nothing brings it "
"back"
msgstr "Apagar nodo — todos los servidores de {node} se caen y nada lo recupera"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1036
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shut down node {node}"
msgstr "Apagar el nodo {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1037
msgid "every server on the node goes down, for good"
msgstr "todos los servidores del nodo se caen, definitivamente"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1038
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{servers} server(s) on {node} go down and {players} player(s) are "
"disconnected, and nothing brings the node back.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Se caen {servers} servidor(es) en {node} y se desconectan {players} "
"jugador(es), y nada recupera el nodo.</b>"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1040
msgid ""
"A node shutdown ends the bot process on that machine for good: somebody "
"has to start the node THERE, at the machine. A node that is down cannot "
"be started from this browser, and its servers stay down with it."
msgstr ""
"Un apagado del nodo termina el proceso del bot en esa máquina "
"definitivamente: alguien tiene que iniciar el nodo ALLÍ, en la máquina. "
"Un nodo caído no se puede iniciar desde este navegador, y sus servidores "
"permanecen caídos con él."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1044
msgid ""
"<b>This console runs inside that node</b> — shutting it down ends the "
"process serving this page, and nothing brings it back until somebody "
"starts the node on that machine."
msgstr ""
"<b>Esta consola se ejecuta dentro de ese nodo</b> — apagarlo termina el "
"proceso que sirve esta página, y nada lo recupera hasta que alguien "
"inicie el nodo en esa máquina."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1047
msgid "Shut down node"
msgstr "Apagar nodo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1048
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shut down {node} — every server on it goes down"
msgstr "Apagar {node} — todos sus servidores se caen"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1050
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Actualizar"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1051
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Upgrade node — update DCSServerBot on {node} and restart it; every server"
" on it goes down"
msgstr ""
"Actualizar nodo — actualiza DCSServerBot en {node} y lo reinicia; todos "
"sus servidores se caen"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1053
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Upgrade node {node}"
msgstr "Actualizar el nodo {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1054
msgid "update and restart, every server goes down"
msgstr "actualiza y reinicia, todos los servidores se caen"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1057
msgid ""
"The node is updated and restarted. The console offers Upgrade ONLY while "
"the node itself reports an update pending — it asks every node in the "
"background, never while rendering a page, and this control is gone again "
"once there is nothing to upgrade."
msgstr ""
"El nodo se actualiza y se reinicia. La consola ofrece Actualizar SOLO "
"mientras el propio nodo informa de una actualización pendiente — consulta"
" a cada nodo en segundo plano, nunca al renderizar una página, y este "
"control desaparece de nuevo en cuanto no hay nada que actualizar."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1061
msgid ""
"<b>This console runs inside that node</b> — upgrading it ends the process"
" serving this page, and this window has to be reloaded once the node is "
"back."
msgstr ""
"<b>Esta consola se ejecuta dentro de ese nodo</b> — actualizarlo termina "
"el proceso que sirve esta página, y habrá que recargar esta ventana "
"cuando el nodo vuelva."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1064
msgid "Upgrade node"
msgstr "Actualizar nodo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1065
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Upgrade {node} — every server on it goes down"
msgstr "Actualizar {node} — todos sus servidores se caen"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1080
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1104
msgid "Take servers offline"
msgstr "Poner servidores fuera de línea"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1083
msgid "Also mark them as maintenance"
msgstr "Marcarlos también como mantenimiento"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1085
msgid ""
"On by default: without it a scheduled start can bring the servers back "
"while the node is \"offline\"."
msgstr ""
"Activado por defecto: sin él, un arranque programado puede devolver los "
"servidores mientras el nodo está «fuera de línea»."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1087
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take the servers on {node} offline?"
msgstr "¿Poner fuera de línea los servidores de {node}?"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1088
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Take servers offline — every server on {node} that is up is marked as "
"maintenance and stopped; its players are disconnected, while the node's "
"services stay up"
msgstr ""
"Poner servidores fuera de línea — todos los servidores de {node} que "
"están en marcha se marcan como mantenimiento y se detienen; sus jugadores"
" se desconectan, mientras los servicios del nodo siguen activos"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1091
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take the servers on {node} out of service"
msgstr "Poner los servidores de {node} fuera de servicio"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1092
msgid "marks the node's servers as maintenance and stops them"
msgstr "marca los servidores del nodo como mantenimiento y los detiene"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1093
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{servers} server(s) on {node} go down and {players} player(s) are "
"disconnected.</b> The box below is ticked by default and marks those "
"servers as maintenance — leave it ticked unless you mean to let a "
"scheduled start bring them back while the node is \"offline\"."
msgstr ""
"<b>Se caen {servers} servidor(es) en {node} y se desconectan {players} "
"jugador(es).</b> La casilla de abajo está marcada por defecto y marca "
"esos servidores como mantenimiento — déjala marcada a menos que quieras "
"permitir que un arranque programado los recupere mientras el nodo está "
"«fuera de línea»."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1097
msgid ""
"Only the SERVERS on the node change. The node itself keeps running, so "
"its services — including this console — stay up, and bringing the node "
"back is a job this browser CAN do. With the box ticked the servers are "
"flagged as maintenance before they stop, so they stay out of service "
"until somebody ends that; clear the box and no flag is written at all — "
"the servers stop and nothing keeps the scheduler from starting them "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Solo cambian los SERVIDORES del nodo. El nodo en sí sigue en marcha, así "
"que sus servicios — incluida esta consola — permanecen activos, y "
"recuperar el nodo es una tarea que este navegador SÍ puede hacer. Con la "
"casilla marcada, los servidores se marcan como mantenimiento antes de "
"detenerse, así que quedan fuera de servicio hasta que alguien finalice "
"eso; si la desmarcas no se escribe ninguna marca — los servidores se "
"detienen y nada impide que el programador vuelva a iniciarlos."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1105
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Take {node} offline — {servers} server(s) go down, {players} player(s) "
"are disconnected"
msgstr ""
"Poner {node} fuera de línea — se caen {servers} servidor(es), se "
"desconectan {players} jugador(es)"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1113
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1131
msgid "Bring servers online"
msgstr "Poner servidores en línea"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1115
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring the servers on {node} back online?"
msgstr "¿Volver a poner en línea los servidores de {node}?"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1116
msgid ""
"Bring servers online — clear the maintenance flags this node's power-off "
"set; the scheduler then starts the servers it stopped. A flag set by hand"
" is left alone"
msgstr ""
"Poner servidores en línea — borra las marcas de mantenimiento que dejó el"
" apagado de este nodo e inicia los servidores que detuvo; una marca "
"puesta a mano no se toca"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1119
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring the servers on {node} back into service"
msgstr "Volver a poner en servicio los servidores de {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1120
msgid ""
"ends the maintenance this node's power-off set — the scheduler starts "
"what it stopped"
msgstr ""
"finaliza el mantenimiento que dejó el apagado de este nodo e inicia lo "
"que detuvo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1123
msgid ""
"This reverts EXACTLY the last power-off on this node: it clears only the "
"maintenance flags that operation set, and the servers it stopped are left"
" for the scheduler to start. A flag somebody set by hand is never "
"cleared, and a server that is still in maintenance is not started. If the"
" bot has restarted since the power-off the record is gone, and this then "
"releases every server that is down and not in maintenance, clearing no "
"flag at all — the message says which of the two happened. The node's "
"services were never touched."
msgstr ""
"Esto revierte EXACTAMENTE el último apagado de este nodo: borra solo las "
"marcas de mantenimiento que puso esa operación e inicia solo los "
"servidores que detuvo. Una marca que alguien puso a mano nunca se borra, "
"y un servidor que sigue en mantenimiento nunca se inicia. Si el bot se ha"
" reiniciado desde el apagado, el registro se ha perdido, y entonces esto "
"inicia todos los servidores que están caídos y no en mantenimiento, sin "
"borrar ninguna marca — el mensaje dice cuál de las dos cosas ocurrió. Los"
" servicios del nodo nunca se tocaron."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1132
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Bring {node} online — the flags its power-off set are cleared, and the "
"scheduler starts what it stopped"
msgstr ""
"Poner {node} en línea — se borran las marcas que dejó su apagado y se "
"inicia lo que detuvo"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1600
#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:188
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:151
