#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:208
msgid ""
"Leave it to keep the password, empty it to remove it, type in it to set a"
" new one. Its value is never shown here."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo para conservar la contraseña, vacíalo para quitarla, escribe en él"
" para poner una nueva. Su valor nunca se muestra aquí."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:257
msgid "off"
msgstr "desactivado"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:270
msgid "— unchanged —"
msgstr "— sin cambios —"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:283
msgid "Save writes the file — the change applies when the server next starts."
msgstr ""
"Guardar escribe el archivo — el cambio se aplica cuando el servidor "
"arranque de nuevo."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:283
msgid ""
"DCS reads <span class=\"mono\">serverSettings.lua</span> at boot, so "
"nothing is applied live here. Only the fields you change are submitted."
msgstr ""
"DCS lee <span class=\"mono\">serverSettings.lua</span> al arrancar, así "
"que aquí nada se aplica en vivo. Solo se envían los campos que cambies."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:290
msgid ""
"The console never opens or writes this file: it reads the settings from "
"the bot's in-process snapshot and writes them through the bot's own "
"action, so there is no Expert Mode text editor here."
msgstr ""
"Esta consola nunca abre ni escribe este archivo: lee los ajustes desde la"
" instantánea en proceso del bot y los escribe mediante la propia acción "
"del bot, por lo que aquí no hay un editor de texto en modo experto."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:313
msgid "bot face — servers.yaml"
msgstr "cara del bot — servers.yaml"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:315
msgid ""
"The one part of this page that does not live in <span "
"class=\"mono\">serverSettings.lua</span>: these are the <span "
"class=\"mono\">servers.yaml</span> face, written through the bot's own "
"<span class=\"mono\">Server.update_channels</span>. Pick a channel per "
"row; only the rows you change are submitted."
msgstr ""
"La única parte de esta página que no vive en <span "
"class=\"mono\">serverSettings.lua</span>: esta es la cara de <span "
"class=\"mono\">servers.yaml</span>, escrita mediante el propio <span "
"class=\"mono\">Server.update_channels</span> del bot. Elige un canal por "
"fila; solo se envían las filas que cambies."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:337
msgid "(not in this guild)"
msgstr "(no está en este servidor de Discord)"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:338
msgid "— not set —"
msgstr "— sin definir —"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:344
msgid "Channel changes apply immediately."
msgstr "Los cambios de canal se aplican de inmediato."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:344
msgid ""
"Read from the master's in-process Discord connection: no node is asked "
"and no Discord API call is made on this render."
msgstr ""
"Leído de la conexión de Discord interna del maestro: en este renderizado "
"no se consulta a ningún nodo ni se hace ninguna llamada a la API de "
"Discord."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:344
msgid ""
"The guild's channel list could not be read right now (the bot is not "
"connected to a guild) — only \"not set\" can be chosen."
msgstr ""
"La lista de canales del servidor de Discord no se pudo leer ahora mismo "
"(el bot no está conectado a ninguno) — solo se puede elegir «sin "
"definir»."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:344
msgid ""
"A central admin channel is defined in <span "
"class=\"mono\">bot.yaml</span>, so the per-server admin channel is not "
"shown or edited here."
msgstr ""
"Hay un canal de administración central definido en <span "
"class=\"mono\">bot.yaml</span>, así que el canal de administración por "
"servidor no se muestra ni se edita aquí."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:345
msgid "The channels action is not available in this installation."
msgstr "La acción de canales no está disponible en esta instalación."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:345
msgid "Save channels"
msgstr "Guardar canales"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:366
msgid "bot database — set live, no restart"
msgstr "base de datos del bot — se define en vivo, sin reiniciar"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:368
msgid ""
"The blue and red join passwords. The bot keeps the cleartext in its own "
"database and asks DCS to apply it — a change while the server is running "
"or paused is picked up at its next restart, exactly like <span "
"class=\"mono\">/password</span>. This page never writes <span "
"class=\"mono\">serverSettings.lua</span> itself."
msgstr ""
"Las contraseñas de entrada azul y roja. El bot guarda el texto sin cifrar"
" en su propia base de datos y pide a DCS que lo aplique — un cambio "
"mientras el servidor está en ejecución o en pausa se recoge en su "
"siguiente reinicio, igual que <span class=\"mono\">/password</span>. Esta"
" página nunca escribe <span class=\"mono\">serverSettings.lua</span> por "
"sí misma."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:375
msgid "hash set"
msgstr "hash definido"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:375
msgid "no hash"
msgstr "sin hash"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:394
msgid "Emptying a field removes its password."
msgstr "Vaciar un campo elimina su contraseña."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:394
msgid ""
"A field that is already empty does nothing — so a password shown as empty"
" here (the bot knows only its hash) can be replaced but not removed from "
"this page."
msgstr ""
"Un campo que ya está vacío no hace nada — así que una contraseña que se "
"muestra vacía aquí (el bot solo conoce su hash) se puede reemplazar pero "
"no quitar desde esta página."

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:395
msgid "Save coalition passwords"
msgstr "Guardar contraseñas de coalición"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:445
msgid "rotation list"
msgstr "lista de rotación"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:471
msgid "All"
msgstr "Todas"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:472
#, python-format
msgid "0 of %(count)s selected"
msgstr "0 de %(count)s seleccionadas"

#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:477
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Set the ONE ticked mission as the mission %(server)s loads when it starts"
